      "result_description": "Roche Old Boys CC - 2nd XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "68117",
      "match_notes": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Boconnoc won the toss and elected to field first on a glorious day at the RCG. Roche started quickly and continued this throughout their innings&nbsp;finishing on 234-3, Openers T Rowe (97*) &amp; T Trudgeon (75) with the runs for the home side. In reply Boconnoc lost regular wickets to eventually fall 99 runs short in the 39th over, W Geach (23), D Smith (21) &amp; J Coates Snr (20) with runs for Boconnoc. J Hunkin (4-41), A LeMasurier (2-13) &amp; M Trudgeon (2-35) taking he wickets for the home side.</span></p><br>",
